# Answer 10 · The Root Causes of Gender-Based Violence and How They Intersect in Pakistan (CSS 2025)
@py question 2025-2

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note Separate root causes from triggers, set out six root causes with Pakistani evidence, then show how they intersect — with each other, with women's identities, and across the levels of the ecological model — and how breaking one link weakens the whole cycle.
@ask ① What are the ROOT CAUSES that lead to GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE?
@ask ② HOW do these factors INTERSECT and PERPETUATE violence against women in PAKISTAN?
